BUY NOW PAY LATER (PORTFOLIO MVP MINI PROJECT)

1. merchant register
2. merchant login
3. merchant menambah produk

4. customer register
5. customer login
6. customer browse product product
7. customer checkout dengan memilih tenor

8. merchant meng-accept order / meng-cancel order

9. jika merchant accept, loan & installment dibuat

10. customer membayar salah satu installment & repayment dibuat
domain: user (untuk register & login) , merchant (untuk p)